@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Melacak Status Pesanan

actor "Pelanggan" as Pelanggan
participant "PesananView" as PesananView
participant "App (state)" as AppState

Pelanggan -> AppState : Klik tombol "Pesanan"
AppState -> PesananView : navigateTo("pesanan") -> tampilkan PesananView(currentOrder)

PesananView --> Pelanggan : Nomor pesanan, tahap (4 langkah), kurir & resi, estimasi tiba
PesananView --> Pelanggan : Barang pesanan, alamat pengiriman, rincian pembayaran VA

opt klik "Pratinjau tahap" (demo)
    Pelanggan -> PesananView : Pilih tahap Dibuat / Diproses / Dikirim / Tiba
    PesananView -> AppState : setOrderStage(tahap)
    AppState --> PesananView : tahap & resi diperbarui (resi tampil mulai DIKIRIM)
    PesananView --> Pelanggan : Timeline diperbarui
end

@enduml